<section class="pagehead" style="border-bottom:0">
  <p class="prompt">tail -n 50 ~/notes/field.log</p>
  <h1>50 field notes</h1>
  <p class="lede">The things that only show up after you have shipped something and watched it break. Each one is a claim plus the reason it is true — no filler, and nothing here that I would not say in a code review.</p>
  <p class="meta"><span class="k">notes</span> <span class="v">50</span><span class="sep">|</span><span class="k">read</span> <span class="v">~12m</span><span class="sep">|</span><span class="k">by</span> <span class="v"><a href="https://x.com/ka1manov" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">@ka1manov</a></span></p>
</section>

<div class="withaside">
<aside class="withaside__nav">
